/**
 * Photography for the prototype.
 *
 * Files live in `public/photos` rather than a remote CDN: the Next.js image optimiser fetches
 * remote sources from the server, so a sandboxed or offline environment renders nothing. Local
 * assets also keep the demo fast and identical everywhere.
 *
 * Each photo ships a 16px blur placeholder so images fade in instead of popping. `<Photo>`
 * resolves the placeholder automatically from the src — components just pass `IMAGES.catering`.
 *
 * Source: Unsplash, used under the Unsplash License. Swap in commissioned Rwandan photography
 * before launch.
 */

